tr:

'<p class="l-text"><strong>Do\u011frusal cebir</strong>, makine \u00f6\u011frenimi, bilgisayar grafi\u011fi ve bilimsel hesaplaman\u0131n matematiksel omurgas\u0131d\u0131r. NumPy\'nin <code>np.linalg</code> mod\u00fcl\u00fc, matris i\u015flemleri, ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmalar ve \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcc\u00fclerin \u00fcretim kalitesinde uygulamalar\u0131n\u0131 sunar \u2014 hepsi LAPACK ve BLAS ile desteklenir; bunlar MATLAB ve R\'da kullan\u0131lan ayn\u0131 sava\u015f-test edilmi\u015f Fortran k\u00fct\u00fcphaneleridir. Bu derste matrisleri \u00e7arpmay\u0131, do\u011frusal sistemleri \u00e7\u00f6zmeyi, matrisleri ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmay\u0131 ve mesafeleri \u00f6l\u00e7meyi \u00f6\u011freneceksiniz \u2014 hepsi tek bir Python d\u00f6ng\u00fcs\u00fc olmadan.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Neden NumPy\'da do\u011frusal cebir?</strong> Her sinir a\u011f\u0131 ileri ge\u00e7i\u015fi bir matris \u00e7arp\u0131mlar\u0131 dizisidir. PCA, SVD ve \u00f6zde\u011fer ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131 boyut azaltmay\u0131 g\u00fc\u00e7lendirir. Do\u011frusal sistemleri \u00e7\u00f6zmek do\u011frusal regresyonun temelidir. <code>np.linalg</code>\'i anl\u0131yorsan\u0131z, ML\'nin \u00e7o\u011funun arkas\u0131ndaki hesaplama motorunu anl\u0131yorsunuz.</div>'
+ '<div class="lesson-outcomes" style="background:rgba(200,169,110,0.06);border-left:3px solid #c8a96e;padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin:1.5rem 0;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0"><div style="font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#c8a96e;margin-bottom:0.6rem">📍 BU DERSTE ÖĞRENECEKSİN</div><ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.3rem;line-height:1.65;font-size:0.93rem;color:rgba(235,230,220,0.92)"><li>np.dot ve @ operatörü ile nokta çarpımı ve matris çarpımı hesapla</li><li>numpy.linalg ile matris tersi, determinant ve rank hesapla</li><li>Ax=b doğrusal sistemini np.linalg.solve ve en küçük kareler ile çöz</li><li>Boyut indirgeme için SVD ve özayrıştırma ile matrisleri ayrıştır</li><li>Bir matrisin tekil olduğunu tanı ve sayısal kararsızlıktan kaçın</li></ul></div>'


/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 1: Nokta \u00c7arp\u0131m\u0131 ve Matris \u00c7arp\u0131m\u0131
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">1. Nokta \u00c7arp\u0131m\u0131 ve Matris \u00c7arp\u0131m\u0131</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Nokta \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131</strong>, do\u011frusal cebirdeki en temel i\u015flemdir. \u0130ki 1 boyutlu dizi i\u00e7in eleman baz\u0131nda \u00e7arp\u0131mlar\u0131n toplam\u0131n\u0131 hesaplar. 2 boyutlu diziler i\u00e7in <strong>matris \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131</strong>na d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f\u00fcr \u2014 her sinir a\u011f\u0131 katman\u0131n\u0131, her PCA projeksiyonunu ve her do\u011frusal d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f\u00fcm\u00fc y\u00fcr\u00fcten i\u015flem.</p>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Nokta \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131 \u2014 iki vekt\u00f6r\u00fcn eleman \u00e7arp\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131n toplam\u0131:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$\\mathbf{a} \\cdot \\mathbf{b} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} a_i b_i = \\|\\mathbf{a}\\|\\,\\|\\mathbf{b}\\|\\cos\\theta$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">a \u00b7 b</div><div class="card-body">a ve b vekt\u00f6rlerinin nokta \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131 (skaler). \u0130ki e\u015fde\u011fer tan\u0131m: cebirsel (\u00e7arp\u0131mlar\u0131n toplam\u0131) ve geometrik (uzunluklar \u00e7arp\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131n\u0131n kosin\u00fcs\u00fc).</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">a_i, b_i</div><div class="card-body">Vekt\u00f6rlerin i\'inci bile\u015fenleri. \u0130ki vekt\u00f6r de ayn\u0131 n boyutuna sahip olmal\u0131d\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u2016a\u2016, \u2016b\u2016</div><div class="card-body">Vekt\u00f6rlerin uzunluklar\u0131 (b\u00fcy\u00fckl\u00fckleri). Daima pozitiftir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">cos \u03b8</div><div class="card-body">\u0130ki vekt\u00f6r aras\u0131ndaki a\u00e7\u0131n\u0131n kosin\u00fcs\u00fc. cos 0\u00b0 = 1 (paralel, en b\u00fcy\u00fck \u00e7arp\u0131m), cos 90\u00b0 = 0 (dik), cos 180\u00b0 = \u22121 (z\u0131t y\u00f6nl\u00fc).</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Neden \u00f6nemli</div><div class="card-body">Benzerlik, izd\u00fc\u015f\u00fcm ve sinir a\u011f\u0131 katmanlar\u0131n\u0131n (Wx + b) temeli. Transformer\'daki her dikkat skoru bir nokta \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131d\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Matris \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131 \u2014 eleman bazl\u0131 tan\u0131m:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$C_{ij} = \\sum_{k=1}^{p} A_{ik} B_{kj}$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">C_{ij}</div><div class="card-body">C = AB sonucunun i. sat\u0131r, j. s\u00fctunundaki eleman.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">A_{ik}</div><div class="card-body">A\'n\u0131n i. sat\u0131r, k. s\u00fctunundaki eleman. k de\u011fi\u015ftik\u00e7e A\'n\u0131n i. sat\u0131r\u0131 boyunca taran\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">B_{kj}</div><div class="card-body">B\'nin k. sat\u0131r, j. s\u00fctunundaki eleman. k de\u011fi\u015ftik\u00e7e B\'nin j. s\u00fctunu boyunca taran\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">k \u00fczerinde \u03a3</div><div class="card-body">Toplam ortak/i\u00e7 boyut p boyunca y\u00fcr\u00fcr. C_{ij}, A\'n\u0131n i. sat\u0131r\u0131 ile B\'nin j. s\u00fctununun nokta \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131d\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u015eekil kural\u0131</div><div class="card-body">A (m \u00d7 p), B (p \u00d7 n) ise C (m \u00d7 n) olur. \u0130\u00e7 p boyutu e\u015fle\u015fmeli; d\u0131\u015f m \u00d7 n sonucun \u015fekli olur.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.dot(a, b)</div><div class="card-body">Genel ama\u00e7l\u0131: 1B nokta \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131, 2B matris \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131, NB son/sondan ikinci eksen toplam\u0131. \u0130svi\u00e7re \u00e7ak\u0131s\u0131.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">a @ b</div><div class="card-body">Matris \u00e7arp\u0131m operat\u00f6r\u00fc (Python 3.5+). Daha temiz s\u00f6zdizimi, np.matmul ile ayn\u0131 sonu\u00e7. Okunabilirlik i\u00e7in tercih edilir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.matmul</div><div class="card-body">Kat\u0131 matris \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131. Skalerleri broadcast ETMEZ. 3B+ diziler i\u00e7in toplu \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131 destekler (matris y\u0131\u011f\u0131nlar\u0131).</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">inner / outer</div><div class="card-body">np.inner = son eksen boyunca nokta \u00e7arp\u0131m. np.outer = rank-1 d\u0131\u015f \u00e7arp\u0131m, n ve m uzunlu\u011fundaki vekt\u00f6rlerden (n,m) matris \u00fcretir.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># === 1B Nokta \u00c7arp\u0131m\u0131 ===</span>\na = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">3</span>])\nb = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">4</span>, <span class="num">5</span>, <span class="num">6</span>])\n\n<span class="fn">print</span>(np.<span class="fn">dot</span>(a, b))     <span class="cm"># 32  (1*4 + 2*5 + 3*6)</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(a @ b)             <span class="cm"># 32  (ayn\u0131 \u015fey)</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(np.<span class="fn">inner</span>(a, b))   <span class="cm"># 32  (1B i\u00e7in ayn\u0131)</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># === Matris \u00c7arp\u0131m\u0131 (2B) ===</span>\nA = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([[<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">2</span>],\n              [<span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">4</span>]])   <span class="cm"># (2, 2)</span>\nB = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([[<span class="num">5</span>, <span class="num">6</span>],\n              [<span class="num">7</span>, <span class="num">8</span>]])   <span class="cm"># (2, 2)</span>\n\n<span class="fn">print</span>(A @ B)\n<span class="cm"># [[19 22]     1*5+2*7  1*6+2*8</span>\n<span class="cm">#  [43 50]]    3*5+4*7  3*6+4*8</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># === \u015eekil Kurallar\u0131 ===</span>\nC = np.<span class="fn">ones</span>((<span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">4</span>))   <span class="cm"># (3, 4)</span>\nD = np.<span class="fn">ones</span>((<span class="num">4</span>, <span class="num">5</span>))   <span class="cm"># (4, 5)</span>\nresult = C @ D           <span class="cm"># (3, 5)  i\u00e7 boyutlar e\u015fle\u015fmeli!</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># === D\u0131\u015f \u00c7arp\u0131m ===</span>\nu = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">3</span>])\nv = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">10</span>, <span class="num">20</span>])\n<span class="fn">print</span>(np.<span class="fn">outer</span>(u, v))\n<span class="cm"># [[10 20]</span>\n<span class="cm">#  [20 40]</span>\n<span class="cm">#  [30 60]]</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>\u015eekil uyumlulu\u011fu:</strong> <code>A @ B</code> i\u00e7in A\'n\u0131n <em>s\u00fctun</em> say\u0131s\u0131, B\'nin <em>sat\u0131r</em> say\u0131s\u0131na e\u015fit olmal\u0131d\u0131r. Sonu\u00e7 \u015fekli (A\'n\u0131n sat\u0131rlar\u0131, B\'nin s\u00fctunlar\u0131) olur. Bu, matris \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131ndaki en \u00f6nemli kurald\u0131r.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-compare">'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">UYUMLU</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">(2,3) @ (3,4) \u2192 (2,4)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">(5,1) @ (1,5) \u2192 (5,5)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">(n,k) @ (k,m) \u2192 (n,m)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">(3,) @ (3,) \u2192 skaler</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">(3,4) @ (4,) \u2192 (3,)</div></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">UYUMSUZ</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">(2,3) @ (2,3) \u2192 HATA</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">(4,5) @ (4,5) \u2192 HATA</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">(3,) @ (4,) \u2192 HATA</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item"><em>\u0130\u00e7 boyutlar e\u015fle\u015fmelidir</em></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item"><em>A.shape[1] == B.shape[0]</em></div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># === Toplu Matris \u00c7arp\u0131m\u0131 (3B) ===</span>\n<span class="cm"># (3,4) \u015feklinde 10 matris \u00e7arp\u0131 (4,5) \u015feklinde 10 matris</span>\nbatch_A = np.random.<span class="fn">randn</span>(<span class="num">10</span>, <span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">4</span>)\nbatch_B = np.random.<span class="fn">randn</span>(<span class="num">10</span>, <span class="num">4</span>, <span class="num">5</span>)\nbatch_C = batch_A @ batch_B  <span class="cm"># (10, 3, 5) \u2014 her matris ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z \u00e7arp\u0131l\u0131r</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># === Matris-Vekt\u00f6r \u00c7arp\u0131m\u0131 ===</span>\nW = np.random.<span class="fn">randn</span>(<span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">4</span>)   <span class="cm"># a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131k matrisi</span>\nx = np.random.<span class="fn">randn</span>(<span class="num">4</span>)       <span class="cm"># girdi vekt\u00f6r\u00fc</span>\noutput = W @ x               <span class="cm"># (3,) \u2014 bu bir sinir a\u011f\u0131 katman\u0131!</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># === np.dot vs @ y\u00fcksek boyutlar i\u00e7in ===</span>\n<span class="cm"># np.dot: A\'n\u0131n SON ekseni ile B\'nin SONDAN \u0130K\u0130NC\u0130 ekseni \u00fczerinden toplar</span>\n<span class="cm"># np.matmul/@: son 2 boyutu matris olarak i\u015fler, gerisini broadcast eder</span>\n<span class="cm"># 2B diziler i\u00e7in ayn\u0131d\u0131r. 3B+ i\u00e7in @/matmul tercih edin.</span></code></pre></div>'

